#: src/components/organisms/MatchmakingLab.re.mjs:134
msgid ""
"What the app ships as Competitive+: calibrates with variety while the "
"ratings are noise, then blends into banded play as they settle. Identical to "
"the static profile once the ladder has any spread."
msgstr ""
"此即應用程式內建的競技+模式：在評級雜訊較大時以多樣化對戰進行校準，隨著評級趨"
"於穩定後逐漸融入分級對戰。一旦排行榜出現差距，表現與靜態模式完全相同。"

#: src/components/organisms/MatchmakingLab.re.mjs:57
msgid "Within-band inversion"
msgstr "同級別內反轉"

#: src/components/organisms/MatchmakingLab.re.mjs:1757
#~ msgid ""
#~ "a bunched pack, most players hard to tell apart, nobody outside the group"
#~ msgstr "密集群組，大多數球員難以區分，無人明顯突出"

#: src/components/organisms/MatchmakingLab.re.mjs:146
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Maximum rotation. Its unbalanced splits are what let it recover a broken "
#~ "ladder."
#~ msgstr "最大輪換。其不均衡的分組正是讓它能修復破損階梯的原因。"

#: src/components/organisms/MatchmakingLab.re.mjs:142
#~ msgid ""
#~ "No preferences at all: no balancing, no rotation, pure jitter. The floor "
#~ "every real strategy should beat on match quality — and, surprisingly, the "
#~ "fastest early learner."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "完全無偏好：不平衡、不輪換、純隨機。這是每個真實策略在比賽品質上都應超越的"
#~ "基準——而且出乎意料地，它是早期學習最快的。"

#: src/components/organisms/MatchmakingLab.re.mjs:1170
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Pick a scenario and press Run. Each round is a real solve through the "
#~ "same optimiser the app uses, so a run takes a few seconds."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "選擇一個情境並按執行。每一輪都是透過應用程式所使用的同一個最佳化器進行真實"
#~ "求解，因此執行需要幾秒鐘。"

#: src/components/organisms/MatchmakingLab.re.mjs:148
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Players self-sort into a beginner group and an intermediate/advanced "
#~ "group and stay there, mixing only around the middle of the pool. Teams "
#~ "are drawn at random within a level and never evened out; a blowout gets "
#~ "run back and a close game keeps the same four on court."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "玩家自行分為初學者組和中高級組並留在原組，僅在組別交界處混合。隊伍在同一級"
#~ "別內隨機組成且從不均衡調整；大比分差的比賽會重賽，而勢均力敵的比賽則保持原"
#~ "來四人繼續上場。"

#: src/components/organisms/MatchmakingLab.re.mjs:106
#~ msgid "Random Balanced"
#~ msgstr "隨機均衡"

#: src/components/organisms/MatchmakingLab.re.mjs:144
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Random composition with partner and opponent rotation, but still no team "
#~ "balancing. Isolates what novelty alone buys over pure chance."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "隨機組成，搭配夥伴與對手輪換，但仍不進行隊伍平衡。用於隔離單純新鮮感相對於"
#~ "純隨機所帶來的效益。"

#: src/components/organisms/MatchmakingLab.re.mjs:118
#~ msgid "Random, no repeats"
#~ msgstr "隨機，不重複"

#: src/components/organisms/MatchmakingLab.re.mjs:1146
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Ranked by the three columns combined, weighted equally. Rows below the "
#~ "dashed line matchmake from hidden true skill — they mark the ceiling and "
#~ "are excluded from the ranking and the highlights. places off = how far "
#~ "the average player sits from their true rank (lower better) · quality = "
#~ "chance a game ends level, by true skill (higher better) · blowouts = "
#~ "share of games decided by 9+ (lower better). Bold marks the best in each "
#~ "column."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "依三欄合併排名，權重相同。虛線以下的列從隱藏真實技能進行配對——代表上限，排"
#~ "除於排名與亮點標示之外。名次偏差 = 平均玩家距其真實排名的距離（越低越好）"
#~ "· 品質 = 依真實技能計算比賽打平的機率（越高越好）· 大比分差 = 分差 9 分以"
#~ "上的比賽佔比（越低越好）。粗體標示各欄最佳值。"

#: src/components/organisms/MatchmakingLab.re.mjs:1370
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Ranked by the three columns combined, weighted equally. Rows below the "
#~ "dashed line matchmake from hidden true skill — they mark the ceiling and "
#~ "are excluded from the ranking. places off = how far the average player "
#~ "sits from their true rank (lower better) · quality = chance a game ends "
#~ "level, by true skill (higher better) · blowouts = share of games decided "
#~ "by 9+ (lower better)."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "依三欄合併排名，權重相同。虛線以下的列以隱藏真實技能進行配對——標示上限並排"
#~ "除於排名之外。名次偏差 = 球員平均距離其真實排名的差距（越低越好）・品質 = "
#~ "依真實技能計算比賽勢均力敵的機率（越高越好）・大比分差 = 比分差距達 9 分以"
#~ "上的比賽比例（越低越好）。"

#: src/components/organisms/MatchmakingLab.re.mjs:1757
#~ msgid "skill spread evenly across the range, plus a ringer and a beginner"
#~ msgstr "技能均勻分佈於範圍內，另含一名尖子球員與一名新手"

